{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Telepathic Earwig Swarm","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/telepathic-earwig-swarm.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/telepathic-earwig-swarm.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Telepathic Earwig Swarm","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":81,"temp":0,"max":81,"details":""},"ac":{"value":24,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"area-damage","value":8,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"splash-damage","value":8,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"bludgeoning","value":4,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]},{"type":"piercing","value":8,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]},{"type":"slashing","value":8,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["aklo","common"],"details":"telepathy 60 feet"},"level":{"value":6},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Telepathic earwigs resemble tiny brown insects with long antennae and pincers on their abdomens. Unable to reproduce on their own, these earwigs have developed a unique life cycle: they insert themselves into a host's body, use their telepathic powers to control the mind of their host, and then begin the process of using the creature to incubate new earwigs. Throughout the gestation, they mentally control the host in order to create a suitable living and reproductive environment. The young earwigs continue to live within the host, taking over its actions and keeping it alive until it is no longer useful. They will use the host to defend themselves if required, but by using their keen intellect and ability to read the host's mind, they are often able to avoid danger and suspicion. When the host outlives their usefulness, the earwigs eject from its body violently, exploding from the host's brain as a new swarm. Telepathic earwigs have learned to use their telepathy to link their minds together when not inside a host, which has the effect of boosting their telepathic powers and allowing them to cast occult spells. Fighting a telepathic earwig swarm isn't necessarily about destroying every single earwig, but instead more about disconnecting the hivemind enough that they can no longer amplify each other's latent telepathic abilities, thereby becoming nothing more than regular earwigs.</p>\n<h2>Ear Today, Gone Tomorrow</h2>\n<p>The name earwig comes from the popular belief that the creatures crawl into people's ears to lay their eggs. Earmuffs and ear plugs are no defense against the telepathic earwig swarm, though. Their eggs can enter the body anywhere, with their telepathic abilities coaxing the body to let down its defenses and absorb their offspring. Not all infestations are lethal, however. A strong enough blast of psychic energy can cause a swarm to exit the host prematurely, in which case they do pour out of the ears in their rush to escape the mental damage.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 30/65/125 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> shield, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Occultism)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, energy resistant (positive), force, mental, spells (Occult: calm emotions, charm, command, confusion, daze, ghost sound, telekinetic maneuver), wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Brite Cheneye","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":3}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":14,"senses":[],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":12},"athletics":{"base":10},"occultism":{"base":15}},"traits":{"value":["aberration","swarm"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/telepathic-earwig-swarm.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Telepathy 60 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telepathy","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","magical"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126509252,"modifiedTime":1689126517267,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kdhbPaBMK1d1fpbA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"UxkEpaPCywZBs4jA"},{"name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":13,"dc":21},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126617172,"modifiedTime":1689126673988,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/confusion.webp","name":"Confusion","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You befuddle your target with strange impulses, causing it to act randomly. The effects are determined by the target's Will save. You can Dismiss the spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target babbles incoherently and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns to end the confusion.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Confused for 1 minute, with no save to end early.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"confusion","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126628422,"modifiedTime":1689126628422,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.LiGbewa9pO0yjbsY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"wEzUN6eoMd0MfCPW"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/calm-emotions.webp","name":"Calm Emotions","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You forcibly calm creatures in the area, soothing them into a nonviolent state; each creature must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Calming urges impose a -1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Any emotion effects that would affect the creature are suppressed and the creature can't use hostile actions. If the target is subject to hostility from any other creature, it ceases to be affected by calm emotions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but hostility doesn't end the effect.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Qr5rgoZvI4KmFY0N]{Spell Effect: Calm Emotions}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"calm-emotions","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":10},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126634210,"modifiedTime":1689126634210,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b515AZlB0sridKSq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"ttyuypFsft9ydYVO"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/telekinetic-maneuver.webp","name":"Telekinetic Maneuver","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to Disarm, Shove, or Trip the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-maneuver","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","concentrate","force","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126639000,"modifiedTime":1689126639000,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.mrDi3v933gsmnw25","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"n1DzDkfNvw1e7xPc"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/charm.webp","name":"Charm","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of charm, unless it identifies the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{Friendly} toward you. If it was Friendly, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful}. It can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes Helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"charm","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126643964,"modifiedTime":1689126643964,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLA0q0WOK2YPuJs6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"TE9TLD2zENe9bue5"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/command.webp","name":"Command (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't Delay or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures."},"rules":[],"slug":"command","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","linguistic","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the end of the target's next turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126651366,"modifiedTime":1689126657733,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aIHY2DArKFweIrpf","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"RE9xJurmXAj6aJ6W"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"At-Will Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-will-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126663268,"modifiedTime":1689126663268,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.2YRDYVnC1eljaXKK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"jA3OPtxWqqxllUjy"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/daze.webp","name":"Daze","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"daze","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"0","type":"mental","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126668459,"modifiedTime":1689126668459,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"ISGQeQTR7s9QsJ8W"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ghost-sound.webp","name":"Ghost Sound","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghost-sound","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","cantrip","concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NDZasgeEkPoZFHGr"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"120 feet"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126672542,"modifiedTime":1689126672542,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.atlgGNI1E1Ox3O3a","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"39sYNRqvEHxpsem4"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Psychic Sunder","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The telepathic earwig swarm's previous action was Telepathic Barrage and a creature failed its saving throw and took mental damage</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The earwig swarm focuses its telepathic powers on breaking down the mental defenses of its victim. The swarm chooses a creature that failed its saving throw against the Telepathic Barrage and took mental damage. That creature becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1}. This is cumulative across multiple uses of Psychic Sunder to a maximum of @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 4}. A creature who reaches stupefied 4 in this way (or who is already stupefied 4) is exposed to the swarm's earwig infection. The stupefied condition from Telepathic Sunder decreases by 1 every hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cqh7FVh0UBWDUqQC","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689126687327,"modifiedTime":1689126764925,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Earwig Infection","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:24]</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> stupefied condition from Psychic Sunder doesn't decrease on its own (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Same as stage 1 and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Drained]{Drained 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Same as stage 1, drained 1, and the creature must attempt a @Check[type:flat|dc:5] before taking any action or lose the action (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> Same as stage 2 and the creature must attempt a @Check[type:flat|dc:11] before taking any action or lose the action (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> The 